      <h3>Broken Spring Replacement</h3>
      <p>A snapped spring stops your door cold—and it almost always happens at the worst time. Planting season, harvest, or a January morning when you need to get to work. We carry high-cycle replacement springs for residential and heavy-duty agricultural applications, replace both springs at once, and balance the door before we leave. Beal City and Denver Township are close enough that we can often get there same-day.</p>
    </a>

