    </a>

    <a href="/services/opener-repair" class="core-services-card opener">
      <h3>Opener Repair & Installation</h3>
      <p>Grinding, humming, reversing for no reason, or just completely dead—opener problems come in a lot of forms and we track them down fast. We service all major brands and can upgrade you to a smart opener with Wi-Fi control when it's time. Remote access is a practical convenience for farm properties where you're moving between buildings all day.</p>
    </a>
<!--
